  "title": "Scale agentic AI from on-device to cloud orchestration",
  "description": "Modern AI systems span client, edge, and cloud rather than a single model. Explore how agentic AI workloads operate across these environments through three demos: real‑time on‑device agents, distributed inference across edge systems, and enterprise‑scale multi‑agent orchestration on Azure Kubernetes Service with Intel Xeon. Leave with practical guidance on placing inference, reasoning, and orchestration where they make the most sense to balance responsiveness, scale, and efficiency.\n\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
